    <CATEGORY Name="Hints">
        <Entry Name="SanityAdd">As ye make progress or plunder important items, ye'll recover some lost sanity.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="LanternNoItem">Ye need to find a lantern before ye can light one.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="LanternNoOil">There be no Oil left in the Lantern. Ye need to find some oil and use it to make the lantern work again.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="LeanHint">Press $ButLeanLeft or $ButLeanRight to lean around corners or peek into narrow places. Or use $ButLean and look around to lean, savvy?</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PushHint">When holdin' an object, ye can click $ButAttack to give it an extra shove.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="ThrowHint">When holdin' an object, ye can click $ButAttack to hurl the object overboard.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="HINT:">SAGE ADVICE:</Entry>
        <Entry Name="DefaultDeath">Ye have to carry on...</Entry>
        <Entry Name="HintHint">Hints can be turned off in the Ship's Orders menu under the Voyage tab. The Ship's Orders menu be accessed by pressin' $ButExit.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntityWheel">Hold down $ButInteract and do a circular motion with the Right Stick to turn the wheel. The wheel will turn the same way ye rotate.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntityGrab01">When grabbin' an object, press $ButAttack to throw it. Hold down $ButRotate and move the $Look to rotate the object.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntityGrab02">Use the $ButScrollDown and $ButScrollUp or $ButZoomIn and $ButZoomOut to move the object closer to ye or further away.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntityPush">Hold down $ButInteract while movin' with the Left Stick to push. Press $ButAttack fer a mighty shove in the direction ye face.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntitySlide">Move the Left Stick while holdin' down $ButInteract to move the object.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntitySwingDoor">Hold down $ButInteract and move the $Look to move the door. Press $ButAttack to fling the door open or shut, dependin' on the direction ye face.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EntityLever">Hold down $ButInteract and move the $Look in the direction ye want to move the lever.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="DarknessDecrease">Beware! When standin' in darkness, yer sanity will slowly drain. Light the lights in the environment usin' Tinderboxes or search fer other sources o' light.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SanityHit">Witnessin' unsettlin' events will reduce yer sanity. It can be restored by solvin' puzzles and makin' progress.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="SanityLow">Yer sanity be dangerously low. Stay in the light and try to make progress, matey.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickSanityPotion">Use the Sanity Rum to increase yer sanity. To drink it, double click on it in yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory).</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickCoin">Ye have found a bag o' doubloons. When ye have enough doubloons, ye can open chests containin' valuable booty.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickHealthPotion">Use the Medicinal Grog to increase yer health. To drink it, double click on its icon inside yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory).</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickOil">The Lantern drains Oil when it be lit. To add more Oil to the Lantern, double click on the Oil item in yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory).</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickLantern">Ye have plundered the Lantern. When filled with Oil, it can be lit by pressin' $ButLantern or selectin' it in yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory).</Entry>
        <Entry Name="PickTinderbox">Tinderboxes be used to light candles and other light sources in the environment. The current number o' Tinderboxes be shown in yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory).</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EnemySeen">Avoid starin' at enemies for too long. It will drain yer sanity and ye'll eventually be spotted.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="StickyArea">Ye can use objects to reach hard-to-get places.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="HideHint">Ye'd better find a place to hide, ye have no means to defend yerself.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EnemyTip01">If an enemy be near, stay out o' sight and hide in the darkness. Douse yer lantern ($ButLantern), if ye can.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="EnemyTip02">Be careful when enemies be near. Duckin' ($ButCrouch) in the darkness makes ye a lot harder to spot.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="CombineHint">Some items can be combined in yer Sea Chest ($ButInventory). Drag and drop one item onto another to attempt a combination.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RunHint">To scurry, hold down $ButRun while movin'.</Entry>
        <Entry Name="QuestAdded">A Keepsake has been added to yer Captain's Log ($ButJournal). For quick access to yer Keepsakes, press $ButQuestLog. Check 'em whenever ye get stuck!</Entry>
        <Entry Name="RecentlyReadText">Ye can quickly check the most recently read text by pressin' $ButRecentText or by openin' the Captain's Log ($ButJournal).</Entry>
